    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "In the addition of three-digit numbers shown, the letters $x$ and $y$ represent different digits.\n\n$$\\begin{array}{r} 3\\,x\\,y \\\\ +\\ \\ y\\,x\\,3 \\\\ \\hline 1\\,x\\,1\\,x \\end{array}$$\n\nThe value of $y - x$ is",
